WEBVTT

00:00.520 --> 00:03.440
<b>KAMIYA KASSHIN
SCHOOL OF KENDO</b>

00:03.810 --> 00:04.690
<b>An errand?</b>

00:05.020 --> 00:06.020
<b>Kenshin did?</b>

00:06.020 --> 00:08.610
<b>Yeah. He said he might be back late.</b>

00:08.730 --> 00:09.820
<b>I see.</b>

00:10.730 --> 00:12.610
<b>But that's rather strange.</b>

00:13.110 --> 00:16.870
<b>There aren't many places besides us
that Kenshin runs errands for.</b>

00:18.410 --> 00:20.410
<b>- I know! It's a woman!
- Huh?</b>

00:20.410 --> 00:22.450
<b>It's been almost three months
since he arrived,</b>

00:22.450 --> 00:23.830
<b>so there's gotta be one or two—</b>

00:24.250 --> 00:25.580
<b>Ouch!</b>

00:25.580 --> 00:28.500
<b>Why do you always come up
with such twisted ideas?</b>

00:28.500 --> 00:30.420
<b>No need to punch me!</b>

00:30.420 --> 00:31.630
<b>Excuse me.</b>

00:33.130 --> 00:34.380
<b>I heard that in this dojo,</b>

00:34.380 --> 00:37.600
<b>one Himura Battosai could be found.</b>

00:38.510 --> 00:43.770
<b>Oh, my name is Fujita, and I have
been newly assigned to this town.</b>

00:43.770 --> 00:46.100
<b>I had heard about Mr. Himura
from the police chief.</b>

00:48.560 --> 00:51.610
<b>Oh, I see.
You're one of the chief's men.</b>

00:52.480 --> 00:55.780
<b>Unfortunately, Kenshin has stepped out.</b>

00:55.780 --> 00:56.780
<b>Do you need something?</b>

00:56.780 --> 00:58.320
<b>Well, about that...</b>

00:58.530 --> 01:02.160
<b>there has been some unconfirmed intel
shared with the police</b>

01:02.160 --> 01:04.870
<b>that there are people
targeting Mr. Himura.</b>

01:05.710 --> 01:09.340
<b>I am terribly sorry,
but would you mind if I waited for him?</b>

01:09.340 --> 01:10.880
<b>Oh, okay.</b>

01:10.880 --> 01:14.300
<b>He might be coming back home
really late, but if that's fine...</b>

01:14.300 --> 01:15.130
<b>Yes.</b>

01:16.760 --> 01:17.760
<b><i>Kenshin...</i></b>

02:53.020 --> 02:57.030
<b>EPISODE 23: THE WOLF'S FANGS</b>

02:57.780 --> 03:00.240
<b>There are people targeting Ken-san?</b>

03:00.360 --> 03:01.200
<b>Right!</b>

03:01.320 --> 03:03.450
<b>I'm sure they're the ones
that got Sanosuke, too!</b>

03:03.870 --> 03:05.950
<b>He's not dead. Not yet.</b>

03:06.950 --> 03:11.920
<b>But if that really was true,
we're facing an indiscriminate group.</b>

03:12.540 --> 03:15.840
<b>We should be really careful ourselves
from now on as well.</b>

03:16.420 --> 03:20.930
<b>Yeah, but Kenshin,
the man in question, has stepped out.</b>

03:22.050 --> 03:24.510
<b>No need to worry about Ken-san,
even if he's alone.</b>

03:25.220 --> 03:28.720
<b>In any case, we shouldn't
randomly step out looking for him.</b>

03:29.060 --> 03:33.310
<b>The swordsman officer that
the police chief sent is at the dojo,</b>

03:33.310 --> 03:34.980
<b>so it's safer inside than outside.</b>

03:35.560 --> 03:36.650
<b>You're right.</b>

03:41.820 --> 03:43.110
<b>Wow.</b>

03:43.820 --> 03:46.620
<b>I thought all the police swords
were sabers,</b>

03:47.120 --> 03:48.870
<b>but some use Japanese katanas, huh?</b>

03:49.200 --> 03:54.790
<b>As sabers are brittle and unreliable,
I was given special permission.</b>

03:55.500 --> 03:58.960
<b>In the end,
Japanese katanas can't be beat as swords.</b>

04:03.010 --> 04:04.430
<b>He finally croaked.</b>

04:04.640 --> 04:06.720
<b>Six times?</b>

04:06.720 --> 04:08.470
<b>He lasted pretty long.</b>

04:09.770 --> 04:12.390
<b>It's a bit early for your grave,
but let me tell you.</b>

04:13.190 --> 04:15.650
<b>I'm just like Saito and Jine.</b>

04:15.650 --> 04:18.770
<b>We're all assassins hired by politicians.</b>

04:19.280 --> 04:22.950
<b>I actually don't know the reason
why they want you dead.</b>

04:23.200 --> 04:28.160
<b>It's likely some VIP that found out
about you from the Kurogasa case,</b>

04:28.530 --> 04:31.370
<b>and feared his evil deeds
back during the Bakumatsu Era would leak</b>

04:31.370 --> 04:33.790
<b>and requested the assassination.</b>

04:34.540 --> 04:35.460
<b>I see.</b>

04:36.790 --> 04:41.420
<b>Hajime Saito is an assassin,
just like Jine Udo.</b>

04:42.170 --> 04:46.260
<b>I had heard Saito was one of those
who wielded his sword the most</b>

04:46.260 --> 04:51.520
<b>when it came to the assassinations for
disciplining members of the Shinsengumi.</b>

04:52.060 --> 04:53.180
<b>So I see.</b>

04:53.310 --> 04:57.020
<b><i>This guy... he defended all six attacks.</i></b>

04:57.520 --> 05:02.230
<b>So he is still doing such foolish things
in this day and age.</b>

05:02.780 --> 05:06.070
<b>If so, I'll slam it into him
as many times as it takes to kill him!</b>

05:09.620 --> 05:11.580
<b><i>Wha?! Crap, both my arms—</i></b>

05:22.000 --> 05:22.960
<b>Kenshin!</b>

05:23.840 --> 05:24.840
<b>Miss Kaoru.</b>

05:24.840 --> 05:26.970
<b>Oh, you're hurt!</b>

05:27.470 --> 05:29.800
<b>It really was true that you were targeted.</b>

05:30.760 --> 05:33.520
<b>Miss Kaoru, where did you hear that?</b>

05:33.770 --> 05:38.100
<b>The police. The police chief
sent one of his men over to let us know.</b>

05:39.190 --> 05:41.110
<b>This is Mr. Goro Fujita,
assistant inspector</b>

05:41.110 --> 05:43.320
<b>and swordsman for the Metropolitan Police.</b>

05:46.400 --> 05:47.860
<b>From the looks of it...</b>

05:48.360 --> 05:51.830
<b>looks like you had quite a bit of trouble
against someone like Akamatsu.</b>

05:53.700 --> 05:56.580
<b>It seems you have gotten
considerably weaker.</b>

05:58.790 --> 06:03.250
<b>The last time we fought was
on the battlefield at Toba-Fushimi.</b>

06:04.260 --> 06:06.260
<b>So roughly the first time in a decade.</b>

06:06.470 --> 06:07.720
<b>First time in a decade?</b>

06:08.220 --> 06:09.260
<b>I see.</b>

06:09.760 --> 06:12.100
<b>So you changed your name to Goro Fujita.</b>

06:13.430 --> 06:15.810
<b>Captain of the Third Unit
of the Shinsengumi...</b>

06:16.350 --> 06:17.890
<b>Hajime Saito.</b>

06:19.940 --> 06:22.400
<b>Shinsengumi? That means...</b>

06:22.400 --> 06:25.070
<b>This guy was the one after Kenshin.</b>

06:26.320 --> 06:27.530
<b>A decade...</b>

06:27.860 --> 06:30.410
<b>Just two syllables
when you put it into words...</b>

06:30.910 --> 06:34.240
<b>but when you live it,
it was quite a long time.</b>

06:34.660 --> 06:38.460
<b>Yeah. It seems it was long enough
for a man to rot away.</b>

06:40.500 --> 06:45.090
<b>You used to have
this elusive shrewdness about you,</b>

06:45.500 --> 06:50.180
<b>but when it came to battle,
you challenged someone fair and square.</b>

06:51.260 --> 06:54.010
<b>Injuring your enemy's friend
to cause uneasiness...</b>

06:54.510 --> 06:58.430
<b>sending in an underdog, and using
that time to try to hold people hostage,</b>

06:58.430 --> 07:00.730
<b>you never dabbled
in underhanded tactics like this.</b>

07:01.730 --> 07:04.270
<b>Your current self
is no longer the Hajime Saito</b>

07:04.270 --> 07:07.110
<b>that I acknowledged as a samurai,
that you aren't.</b>

07:17.700 --> 07:19.710
<b>Damn you, what's so funny?</b>

07:20.460 --> 07:22.120
<b>Of course it's funny, boy.</b>

07:22.630 --> 07:24.790
<b>How can I not laugh about this?</b>

07:25.130 --> 07:27.050
<b>I had thought that his blade
had gone rusty.</b>

07:27.050 --> 07:29.840
<b>But I didn't think his brain
would be this rusty as well!</b>

07:29.970 --> 07:30.800
<b>Wha—</b>

07:31.090 --> 07:33.390
<b>Akamatsu was an underdog?</b>

07:33.390 --> 07:34.430
<b>Don't be stupid.</b>

07:34.970 --> 07:37.850
<b>Such a nobody
doesn't even rate as an underdog.</b>

07:38.520 --> 07:42.060
<b>The strength of Hitokiri Battosai
is best understood</b>

07:42.060 --> 07:46.110
<b>by us Shinsengumi,
who fought him the most.</b>

07:46.570 --> 07:51.280
<b>However, your current self had a hard time
dealing with someone at Akamatsu's level.</b>

07:51.650 --> 07:56.280
<b>The "rurouni who refuses to kill"
has clearly made you weak.</b>

07:57.370 --> 07:58.620
<b>Kenshin...</b>

07:59.200 --> 08:00.330
<b>Is weak?</b>

08:01.660 --> 08:05.040
<b>Saito, I don't care what you think.</b>

08:05.500 --> 08:09.340
<b>But I'm fine as long as I have
the strength as a rurouni</b>

08:09.340 --> 08:12.010
<b>to protect those that catch my eye.</b>

08:13.220 --> 08:15.090
<b>I no longer need the strength</b>

08:15.090 --> 08:17.930
<b>as a hitokiri that kills people,
that I don't.</b>

08:20.140 --> 08:21.230
<b>Kenshin.</b>

08:23.190 --> 08:25.350
<b>Strength as a rurouni, you say?</b>

08:25.860 --> 08:31.030
<b>In that case, you even fail as a rurouni.</b>

08:34.610 --> 08:39.080
<b>While you fell into my trap and
were struggling against Akamatsu...</b>

08:39.660 --> 08:42.080
<b>I was here the whole time.</b>

08:42.710 --> 08:48.170
<b>In other words, I could have killed them
whenever I felt like it.</b>

08:49.880 --> 08:52.260
<b>This isn't the only time
I'm talking about.</b>

08:52.920 --> 08:55.630
<b>Your so-called
"people that catch your eye"</b>

08:55.630 --> 08:57.930
<b>have been captured by your enemy.</b>

08:58.510 --> 09:04.480
<b>On top of that, you let a fool
like Raijuta afflict a lifelong wound.</b>

09:08.440 --> 09:12.070
<b><i>The police supposedly weren't involved
in the case with Raijuta.</i></b>

09:12.820 --> 09:16.530
<b><i>Can it be that this man has been
after Kenshin for a long time?</i></b>

09:17.490 --> 09:20.240
<b>Halfhearted strength
is as good as nothing.</b>

09:20.740 --> 09:25.410
<b>A hypocrite that is all talk and no action
is simply revolting.</b>

09:25.410 --> 09:26.250
<b>Shut up!</b>

09:26.540 --> 09:30.540
<b>But not one person died in the end,
because Kenshin was here!</b>

09:30.710 --> 09:33.960
<b>But there's no guarantee
that things will keep going this well.</b>

09:37.340 --> 09:38.470
<b>Kenshin.</b>

09:39.220 --> 09:45.060
<b>I sent Akamatsu over, thinking Battosai
would be able to realize that on his own.</b>

09:45.560 --> 09:50.980
<b>But just like you said, a decade
was long enough for a man to rot away.</b>

09:52.270 --> 09:54.490
<b>A rurouni who refuses to kill?</b>

09:54.490 --> 09:56.900
<b>You're drowning
in your own complacent pseudo-justice.</b>

09:57.400 --> 10:01.620
<b>How can Hitokiri Battosai protect people
without slaying other people?</b>

10:03.160 --> 10:04.620
<b>Have you forgotten?</b>

10:05.120 --> 10:07.330
<b>"Evil... immediate... slaughter".</b>

10:08.170 --> 10:09.830
<b>Evil must be slain immediately.</b>

10:10.630 --> 10:12.590
<b>For the Shinsengumi and the hitokiri...</b>

10:13.050 --> 10:17.340
<b>it was the one true justice
that we shared together.</b>

10:19.220 --> 10:23.390
<b>I cannot bear
seeing your current self any longer.</b>

10:25.180 --> 10:26.230
<b>Saito...</b>

10:26.930 --> 10:28.690
<b>no matter what you say...</b>

10:29.060 --> 10:32.690
<b>I have no intention of killing other men
anymore, that I don't.</b>

10:35.780 --> 10:36.650
<b>So be it.</b>

10:41.120 --> 10:42.120
<b>Bring it.</b>

10:43.160 --> 10:46.080
<b>I will oppose everything about you.</b>

10:50.040 --> 10:53.040
<b>RUROUNI KENSHIN</b>

10:58.590 --> 10:59.590
<b>What's wrong?</b>

11:00.050 --> 11:02.260
<b>Are you just going to stand there</b>

11:02.260 --> 11:06.310
<b>and let that girl and boy over there
be hit with Gatotsu, too?</b>

11:14.060 --> 11:14.900
<b>Miss Kaoru.</b>

11:20.240 --> 11:21.860
<b>It will be all right, that it will.</b>

11:21.860 --> 11:22.740
<b>But...</b>

11:23.120 --> 11:25.910
<b>In any case, he is after my life.</b>

11:26.660 --> 11:28.700
<b>I cannot avoid fighting him, that I can't.</b>

11:28.910 --> 11:30.660
<b>But, for some reason...</b>

11:35.960 --> 11:37.380
<b><i>It feels like you just...</i></b>

11:38.760 --> 11:42.340
<b><i>you just will disappear
after this, Kenshin.</i></b>

11:46.890 --> 11:47.720
<b>Bring it.</b>

11:48.220 --> 11:50.560
<b>Weren't you the one challenging me?</b>

11:52.100 --> 11:53.020
<b>I get it.</b>

11:53.770 --> 11:54.690
<b>You're right.</b>

11:58.360 --> 11:59.190
<b>Here goes!</b>

12:02.530 --> 12:04.490
<b>Hiten Mitsurugi-ryu, Ryuutsuisen!</b>

12:04.870 --> 12:08.080
<b>He's not weak at all!
Kenshin really is the strongest!</b>

12:08.450 --> 12:10.410
<b>You think you dodged it
like that, Battosai?</b>

12:10.660 --> 12:11.960
<b><i>An anti-air Gatotsu!</i></b>

12:13.120 --> 12:14.040
<b>Kenshin!</b>

12:16.460 --> 12:19.130
<b>You twisted your waist
to avoid being skewered,</b>

12:19.130 --> 12:20.970
<b>but you didn't think it through!</b>

12:25.090 --> 12:26.850
<b>Even if the piercing attack misses,</b>

12:26.850 --> 12:29.270
<b>you can immediately transition
to a sweeping attack.</b>

12:29.850 --> 12:32.560
<b>The deputy head of the Shinsengumi,</b>

12:32.560 --> 12:36.270
<b>the tactical genius Toshizo Hijikata,
created Hirazuki.</b>

12:36.270 --> 12:37.610
<b>It has no blind spots.</b>

12:38.110 --> 12:41.070
<b>All the more true
when it comes to my Gatotsu.</b>

12:43.360 --> 12:45.700
<b><i>In actual duels to the death,</i></b>

12:45.700 --> 12:49.790
<b><i>it is extremely rare
to come across the same enemy twice.</i></b>

12:50.410 --> 12:54.710
<b><i>Therefore, if you have an attack
that will definitely kill the opponent,</i></b>

12:54.710 --> 12:57.170
<b><i>all other small tricks become pointless.</i></b>

12:57.920 --> 13:01.260
<b><i>Thoroughly brushing up
on one's best attack</i></b>

13:01.260 --> 13:04.430
<b><i>to elevate it into
an absolute sure-kill attack...</i></b>

13:04.840 --> 13:09.100
<b><i>the true strength of the Shinsengumi
was not in group tactics,</i></b>

13:09.100 --> 13:10.850
<b><i>but actually was in this aspect.</i></b>

13:15.480 --> 13:16.310
<b>The katana...</b>

13:16.520 --> 13:17.610
<b>Destruction of weaponry!</b>

13:17.770 --> 13:18.810
<b>Such a useless struggle!</b>

13:23.280 --> 13:28.450
<b>Though nameless, my beloved blade
warded me against countless dangers</b>

13:28.450 --> 13:30.740
<b>from the Bakumatsu Era until now.</b>

13:31.240 --> 13:34.460
<b>That and my attack aren't things
your current self can break through.</b>

13:35.620 --> 13:36.460
<b>Kenshin!</b>

13:36.620 --> 13:37.460
<b>Kensh—</b>

13:42.630 --> 13:44.260
<b>Step aside, girl.</b>

13:46.550 --> 13:47.680
<b>You're in the way.</b>

13:54.230 --> 13:55.180
<b>Here goes.</b>

13:55.770 --> 13:56.690
<b><i>Kenshin.</i></b>

14:00.190 --> 14:02.860
<b><i>The reaction to the second attack
went after my blade.</i></b>

14:03.570 --> 14:05.110
<b><i>Such a thing wouldn't be possible</i></b>

14:05.110 --> 14:07.320
<b><i>if he wasn't faster
than back in the first attack.</i></b>

14:07.660 --> 14:11.530
<b><i>This is despite suffering
quite a wound in his chest.</i></b>

14:12.910 --> 14:14.950
<b><i>In the short while
since he settled down here...</i></b>

14:15.750 --> 14:17.500
<b><i>he has fought multiple enemies.</i></b>

14:17.870 --> 14:21.290
<b><i>And each time,
he has put a victory under his belt</i></b>

14:21.290 --> 14:23.460
<b><i>by waking up the power
of his Hitokiri days.</i></b>

14:24.800 --> 14:26.970
<b><i>Just as I had thought.</i></b>

14:27.420 --> 14:29.590
<b><i>Each time he wields his sword,</i></b>

14:29.590 --> 14:35.180
<b><i>he is surely returning to
Hitokiri Battosai unbeknownst to him.</i></b>

14:37.810 --> 14:38.980
<b><i>He has gotten even faster.</i></b>

14:39.520 --> 14:40.350
<b><i>Wha—</i></b>

14:40.480 --> 14:41.310
<b><i>He disappeared!</i></b>

14:41.810 --> 14:42.650
<b><i>Below!</i></b>

14:47.030 --> 14:48.700
<b><i>What was that just now?</i></b>

14:49.490 --> 14:52.620
<b><i>That movement was far beyond
what I had expected.</i></b>

14:55.580 --> 14:57.290
<b><i>His breathing is too heavy.</i></b>

14:57.710 --> 14:59.920
<b><i>Is he putting out more power
than he's imagining...</i></b>

15:00.500 --> 15:02.670
<b><i>and his body isn't keeping up with him?</i></b>

15:12.300 --> 15:13.720
<b><i>- It can't be.
- It can't be.</i></b>

15:14.810 --> 15:16.180
<b><i>Because he is fighting me...</i></b>

15:16.680 --> 15:19.770
<b><i>his feelings from a decade ago
are showing up more prominently...</i></b>

15:20.270 --> 15:22.650
<b><i>and he has instantaneously returned
to being Battosai.</i></b>

15:24.520 --> 15:27.990
<b><i>Or did he just simply snap?</i></b>

15:31.490 --> 15:32.950
<b><i>To verify...</i></b>

15:36.870 --> 15:38.620
<b>This is the only way.</b>

15:39.120 --> 15:41.330
<b>A genuine Gatotsu.</b>

15:41.960 --> 15:43.330
<b>No holding back.</b>

15:43.960 --> 15:44.790
<b>Wha—</b>

15:44.880 --> 15:47.250
<b>You were holding back on us
the whole time?</b>

15:54.010 --> 15:54.850
<b><i>So fast!</i></b>

15:55.180 --> 15:58.680
<b><i>But he totally forgot about the second
sweeping attack based on how he dodged!</i></b>

15:59.020 --> 16:00.940
<b><i>So he simply snapped after all.</i></b>

16:11.400 --> 16:12.240
<b>So amazing.</b>

16:12.570 --> 16:16.240
<b>As he dodged, he landed an attack
with full centrifugal force into his back.</b>

16:16.700 --> 16:19.410
<b>No matter how amazing Gatotsu may be</b>

16:19.410 --> 16:22.210
<b>if you show it to me
four times in such a short time...</b>

16:22.710 --> 16:26.710
<b>even an idiot
can think of a way or two to counter it.</b>

16:28.380 --> 16:29.710
<b>Stand up, Saito.</b>

16:30.300 --> 16:33.590
<b>If this is how the first battle
in a decade ends,</b>

16:33.590 --> 16:35.090
<b>it's quite unsatisfying, isn't it?</b>

16:40.520 --> 16:41.980
<b>All right.</b>

16:41.980 --> 16:43.690
<b>I changed my mind.</b>

16:44.690 --> 16:46.650
<b>I will kill you now.</b>

16:46.900 --> 16:48.520
<b>Stop dreaming.</b>

16:48.520 --> 16:52.150
<b>"I will kill you now" is my line.</b>

16:57.700 --> 16:58.530
<b>Kaoru?</b>

17:00.240 --> 17:01.500
<b><i>It's the same.</i></b>

17:02.290 --> 17:04.920
<b><i>It's just like that feeling
I had with Jine.</i></b>

17:05.920 --> 17:08.840
<b><i>If I don't do anything,
Kenshin will no longer be here!</i></b>

17:10.960 --> 17:12.800
<b>Stop him. Someone...</b>

17:16.140 --> 17:18.720
<b>Someone, please stop those two!</b>

17:26.730 --> 17:29.480
<b>I will send your head flying
in the next attack.</b>

17:29.730 --> 17:31.230
<b>Amazing.</b>

17:31.230 --> 17:34.320
<b>Today's Kenshin
is even sharper than usual.</b>

17:34.450 --> 17:36.860
<b>You're wrong! That's not Kenshin!</b>

17:36.860 --> 17:38.450
<b>That's Hitokiri Battosai!</b>

17:38.450 --> 17:39.490
<b>Huh?</b>

17:39.490 --> 17:43.200
<b>I have to stop the two of them!
Or else Hitokiri Battosai will—</b>

17:43.200 --> 17:46.120
<b>We can't stop them, missie.</b>

17:47.250 --> 17:48.080
<b>Sanosuke!</b>

17:48.880 --> 17:52.670
<b>Those two aren't fighting
in Meiji Era Tokyo right now.</b>

17:52.670 --> 17:55.130
<b>They're in Bakumatsu Era Kyoto.</b>

17:55.590 --> 17:57.340
<b>The only one that can stop this battle</b>

17:57.340 --> 18:00.100
<b>is someone that lived through
the upheaval of the Bakumatsu Era...</b>

18:00.600 --> 18:05.060
<b>And by that, I mean the few
that had a taste of the turbulent Kyoto.</b>

18:05.480 --> 18:09.480
<b>No matter how much we call for them,
our voices won't reach them anymore.</b>

18:14.740 --> 18:15.570
<b>Kawaji.</b>

18:16.360 --> 18:20.410
<b>How long has it been since Saito
entered this place called Kamiya Dojo?</b>

18:22.740 --> 18:25.580
<b>Approximately four and a half hours.</b>

18:25.830 --> 18:26.710
<b>I see.</b>

18:27.790 --> 18:29.670
<b>We may be arriving there too late.</b>

18:30.290 --> 18:32.040
<b>Please rush the carriage over.</b>

18:32.040 --> 18:33.300
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

18:37.300 --> 18:41.970
<b>As always, men of the Shinsengumi
don't know when to pull back.</b>

18:42.220 --> 18:44.770
<b>First rule of the Shinsengumi,</b>

18:44.770 --> 18:47.060
<b>"Never turn your back
on the samurai code!"</b>

18:47.390 --> 18:50.150
<b>Fleeing before the enemy
is a betrayal of the samurai code!</b>

18:50.520 --> 18:54.150
<b>You choose pride as a Shinsengumi
over your own life.</b>

18:55.030 --> 18:56.650
<b>That is fine in its own right.</b>

18:58.780 --> 18:59.610
<b>Bare hands?</b>

18:59.610 --> 19:01.740
<b>He will create a gap to attack
by striking with his sword.</b>

19:02.070 --> 19:03.200
<b>It's all over!</b>

19:04.990 --> 19:05.830
<b>Wha—</b>

19:06.250 --> 19:07.200
<b>A belt?</b>

19:07.200 --> 19:08.290
<b>When did he...</b>

19:09.040 --> 19:10.330
<b>This one's mine!</b>

19:12.590 --> 19:14.090
<b>- Ken-san!
- Crap!</b>

19:14.090 --> 19:15.170
<b>This is...</b>

19:15.550 --> 19:16.630
<b>the end!</b>

19:17.550 --> 19:18.880
<b>He's gonna suffocate him!</b>

19:19.090 --> 19:21.340
<b>It's nothing that simple.</b>

19:21.510 --> 19:24.970
<b>That's trying to snap
the bones in his neck!</b>

19:27.600 --> 19:29.850
<b>It's futile! Stop the useless struggles!</b>

19:47.120 --> 19:48.500
<b>This is...</b>

19:48.500 --> 19:50.120
<b>how they fought in the Bakumatsu Era.</b>

19:51.000 --> 19:53.330
<b>Neither have any strength left in them.</b>

19:53.500 --> 19:55.710
<b>The next blow will be the last.</b>

19:56.750 --> 20:00.220
<b>Life or death?
Or will they both go down?</b>

20:01.930 --> 20:04.050
<b><i>Kenshin.</i></b>

20:05.140 --> 20:06.350
<b>How about...</b>

20:07.100 --> 20:08.520
<b>we end it soon?</b>

20:09.020 --> 20:10.480
<b>Right.</b>

20:11.190 --> 20:12.020
<b>Kaoru!</b>

20:13.100 --> 20:13.980
<b>Kenshin!</b>

20:14.770 --> 20:15.610
<b>Ken—</b>

20:19.190 --> 20:22.150
<b>No!</b>

20:24.160 --> 20:25.530
<b>Stop it!</b>

20:26.580 --> 20:28.540
<b>Come to your senses, Saito!</b>

20:28.540 --> 20:32.790
<b>Your mission was to adjudicate
the abilities of Battosai!</b>

20:34.000 --> 20:36.000
<b>We're having a good time right now.</b>

20:36.000 --> 20:39.300
<b>I won't allow anyone
to stand in the way, not even you.</b>

20:40.760 --> 20:46.300
<b>I am fully aware of how much pride
you have as one of the Shinsengumi.</b>

20:47.010 --> 20:47.850
<b>However...</b>

20:48.350 --> 20:50.390
<b>I don't want either you or Himura</b>

20:50.390 --> 20:53.310
<b>to lose your life in vain
in a place like this.</b>

20:55.020 --> 20:56.270
<b>I see.</b>

20:56.810 --> 21:00.230
<b>So the mastermind
behind Hajime Saito was you.</b>

21:00.730 --> 21:02.900
<b>Former Revolutionary warrior
from Satsuma...</b>

21:03.400 --> 21:05.700
<b>and Home Minister
of the Meiji government...</b>

21:05.700 --> 21:07.450
<b>Toshimichi Okubo.</b>

22:45.050 --> 22:50.050
<b>NEXT EPISODE
MEIJI 11, MAY 14TH</b>

22:45.880 --> 22:49.550
<b><i>Next episode, "Meiji 11, May 14th."</i></b>
